            "text": ". Si el rival pone su torre en la columna, la tuya de delante puede capturarla y la de detrás recaptura."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "A rook on an open file can be traded for the rival rook. To keep the file, put both rooks one behind the other: they are "
